---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Côd Ymddygiad" title_en="Code of Conduct">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Côd Ymddygiad</span><span lang="en">Code of Conduct</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/documents/"><span lang="cy">Dogfennau</span><span lang="en">Documents</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Côd Ymddygiad</span><span lang="en">Code of Conduct</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Côd Ymddygiad Aelodau</span><span lang="en">Members' Code of Conduct</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">Mae Côd Ymddygiad Llywodraeth Cymru yn berthnasol i holl aelodau Cyngor Cymuned Llansannan. Mae'n nodi'r safonau ymddygiad y disgwylir i bob cynghorydd eu bodloni wrth gyflawni eu dyletswyddau cyhoeddus.</p>
    <p lang="en">The Welsh Government's Code of Conduct applies to all members of Llansannan Community Council. It sets out the standards of conduct expected of all councillors when carrying out their public duties.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Prif egwyddorion</span><span lang="en">Key principles</span></h3>
    <p lang="cy">Mae'r Côd Ymddygiad yn seiliedig ar yr <a href="/documents/nolan-principles/">Egwyddorion Nolan</a> — saith egwyddor bywyd cyhoeddus — ac yn cynnwys y dyletswyddau i:</p>
    <p lang="en">The Code of Conduct is based on the <a href="/documents/nolan-principles/">Nolan Principles</a> — seven principles of public life — and includes duties to:</p>
    <ul lang="cy">
      <li>Gweithredu er budd y cyhoedd, nid buddiannau personol</li>
      <li>Datgelu buddiannau personol a chofrestru buddiannau lle bo hynny'n ofynnol</li>
      <li>Peidio â chamdrin neu gamymddwyn tuag at unrhyw berson</li>
      <li>Cydymffurfio â phenderfyniadau cyfreithiol y cyngor</li>
    </ul>
    <ul lang="en">
      <li>Act in the public interest, not personal interests</li>
      <li>Disclose personal interests and register interests where required</li>
      <li>Not bully or behave improperly towards any person</li>
      <li>Comply with lawful decisions of the council</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="minutes-list" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Côd Ymddygiad Llywodraeth Cymru</span><span lang="en">Welsh Government Code of Conduct</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">Wedi'i fabwysiadu gan y cyngor</span><span lang="en">Adopted by the council</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="doc-links">
          <a href="/documents/policies/code-of-conduct.pdf" class="doc-link pdf"><span lang="cy">Côd (dwyieithog) — PDF</span><span lang="en">Code (bilingual) — PDF</span></a>
          <a href="https://www.ombudsman.wales/code-of-conduct/" class="doc-link" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            <span lang="cy">Gwefan yr Ombwdsmon →</span><span lang="en">Ombudsman website →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href="/councillors/interests/"><span lang="cy">Cofrestru Buddiannau Aelodau →</span><span lang="en">Members' Register of Interests →</span></a></p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
